{"id":"wb-6-344","name":"纸坊玉皇阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"纸坊玉皇阁","text":"纸坊玉皇阁或称无梁阁，位于河北省邯郸市峰峰矿区西纸坊村，滏阳河北岸。根据阁下现存重修碑所记载的碑文来判断，最早建于明代隆庆或万历年间。清光绪二十二年（1896年）重新修建。现为全国文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BA%B8%E5%9D%8A%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E9%98%81","revisionId":86761051,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86761051","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f8277d9e18a4fb2d404829ed.jpg","title":"20250122-纸坊玉皇阁.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250122-%E7%BA%B8%E5%9D%8A%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E9%98%81.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/20250122-%E7%BA%B8%E5%9D%8A%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E9%98%81.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Saigyouji-Noriko","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​纸坊玉皇阁","width":320,"height":212}}